{
  "description": "The creature is shown in strict right-facing side profile against a plain off-white background, standing alert with all four legs on the ground and head held high. It has the compact, sturdy build of a small equine with a deep chest, slightly arched back, slender legs and a relatively large head. The coat is short and coarse, light to medium brown over most of the body with a paler, almost white belly and muzzle, and is overlaid with irregular dark brown to black striping. The mane is short, stiff and upright along the top of the neck, the ears are large and pointed, and the tail is thin with a dark tuft at the tip. The overall impression is of a donkey-like animal bearing zebra-like stripes, rendered in detailed natural-history illustration style.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "large, elongated and donkey-like with coarse brown fur, a white muzzle around the nostrils and mouth, a dark eye with a pale eye-ring, visible nostril, lips and whiskers, shown in right profile",
      "where": "at the front end of the body on top of the neck, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, upright, pointed ears with brown outer fur and pale inner fur with dark shading inside the ear cavity, the tips slightly rounded",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly in front of the other, pricked forward"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, bristly upright hairs, dark brown to black with lighter tips, forming a spiky crest",
      "where": "along the dorsal midline of the neck from just behind the ears to the shoulder"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender, straight equine legs with visible knee and hock joints, covered in short fur that is pale on the lower leg and tan-brown with dark transverse stripes on the upper leg and shoulder/haunch",
      "where": "under the body, two forelegs beneath the chest and two hind legs beneath the rump, all visible in side view"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four single-toed, rounded hooves, dark gray-brown with a hard outer wall and flat sole",
      "where": "at the bottom tip of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "thin, narrow tail with short fur at the base and a longer, dark brown to black tuft of hair at the tip, hanging straight down",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the rump at the back of the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "irregular dark brown to black transverse stripes and bands over a tan-brown base coat, including a thin dark dorsal stripe along the spine, a bold vertical shoulder stripe, and multiple stripes across the hindquarters, flanks, neck and lower legs",
      "where": "distributed over the hindquarters, mid-back and sides, shoulder, neck, and all four legs"
    }
  ],
